       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "Halvern Dam on the Sorrel River near Brindlemark, Assek Valley, was reported damaged on 9 September 2025.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "The alert level was raised from Yellow to Orange and a mandatory evacuation was ordered for Brindlemark and Ferris Hollow.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "Roughly 11,800 residents were evacuated from Brindlemark, a figure later given as 12,400, with further movement out of Quennard.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "Brindlemark Police deployed to the town, assistance was provided in Quennard, and the Sorrel Basin Water Authority issued information on the dam.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
